<p>Today's brief covers stories from 3 to 4 November.</p>

<figure class="dgm">
<div class="dgm-stack">
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Tools</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span>Meta and Conductor<em>parallel coding agents</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Web platforms</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">WordPress core<em>exploited update flaw</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Capacity and finance</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span>Google and Anthropic<em>lease backstop</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Physical and political</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">Local voters<em>rejecting data centres</em></span></div></div>
